<title>USA: Price REIT sets offering.</title>
<headline>Price REIT sets offering.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Price REIT Inc Tuesday announced the sale of 600,000 shares of common stock at $32.125 per share in a public offering.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the offering is expected to close on September 13. In addition the company granted the underwriters an option to purchase an additional 90,000 shares to cover over-allotments, if any.</p>
<p>The net proceeds from the offering, approximating $18 million  will be used to repay certain outstanding indebtedness under its line of credit and to fund its acquisition and development activities.</p>
</text>
